{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TtYBDppuO81793616044.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，天水圍嘉湖山莊本月成交價量齊升，錄27宗買賣成交， 較上月升42%，創5個月新高，平均呎價8509元，升0.5%。</p><p> </p><p>伍耀祖表示，嘉湖山莊景湖居4座高層E室，實用面積446平方呎，2房間隔，向東南，景致開揚，原業主開價438萬元放售，經議價後，減價20萬元，以418萬元成交，實用呎價9372元。</p><p> </p><p>伍耀祖指，原業主於1995年6月以139萬元買入單位，持貨約31年，帳面獲利279萬元，單位期內升值2倍。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:24.164885+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.359560+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:39:02.715453+00:00","content_hash":"b28d774e340fd800165012f973049517f7c94d1b4aee1020e9f11b14dc90ff5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:24.164885+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}